---
/**
 * Home page: “Testimonials” section.
 */
---

<div
  class="vb-element vb-element-1fa1766 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent"
  data-id="1fa1766"
  data-element_type="container"
  data-e-type="container"
  data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
>
  <div class="e-con-inner">
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-dbc0fd9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
      data-id="dbc0fd9"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-4ad07b8 vb-widget vb-widget-heading"
        data-id="4ad07b8"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="heading.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container"><h2 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">Testimonials</h2></div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-dbf73ec vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
        data-id="dbf73ec"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container"><p>What Our Clients Say About Us</p></div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-bc5304b vb-hidden-desktop vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
        data-id="bc5304b"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container"><p>CONSULTING</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-9d12add e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child"
      data-id="9d12add"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div class="e-con-inner">
        <div
          class="vb-element vb-element-142014e e-con-full vb-hidden-tablet vb-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con e-child"
          data-id="142014e"
          data-element_type="container"
          data-e-type="container"
        >
          <div
            class="vb-element vb-element-aba732e vb-widget vb-widget-heading"
            data-id="aba732e"
            data-element_type="widget"
            data-e-type="widget"
            id="coaching"
            data-widget_type="heading.default"
          >
            <div class="vb-widget-container"><h2 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">COACHING</h2></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="vb-element vb-element-d5e89f4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
          data-id="d5e89f4"
          data-element_type="container"
          data-e-type="container"
        >
          <div
            class="vb-element vb-element-ff8e131 vb-testimonial--align-left vb-testimonial--skin-bubble vb-testimonial--layout-image_above vb-arrows-yes vb-pagination-type-bullets vb-widget vb-widget-testimonial-carousel"
            data-id="ff8e131"
            data-element_type="widget"
            data-e-type="widget"
            data-settings={'{"slides_per_view":"2","slides_to_scroll":"2","show_arrows":"yes","pagination":"bullets","speed":500,"autoplay":"yes","autoplay_speed":5000,"loop":"yes","pause_on_hover":"yes","pause_on_interaction":"yes","space_between":{"unit":"px","size":10,"sizes":[]},"space_between_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":10,"sizes":[]},"space_between_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":10,"sizes":[]}}'}
            data-widget_type="testimonial-carousel.default"
          >
            <div class="vb-widget-container">
              <div class="vb-swiper">
                <div class="vb-main-swiper swiper" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Slides">
                  <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                    <div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
                      <div class="vb-testimonial">
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__content">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__text">
                            Mathew is a unique Executive / Leadership coach with a blend of business expertise and
                            effective coaching. He engages deeply with coachees to co-create practical approaches,
                            gently nudging them beyond their comfort zones with SMART goals. His holistic approach
                            ensures a balanced perspective. I strongly recommend Mathew to any leader or aspiring leader
                            looking to find their “Alpha” version and achieve greater professional success.
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__footer">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__image">
                            <img
                              decoding="async"
                              src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/Vinod-Shenoy-M-CFO-coaching.jpg"
                              alt="Vinod Shenoy M "
                            />
                          </div>
                          <cite class="vb-testimonial__cite"
                            ><span class="vb-testimonial__name">Vinod Shenoy M </span><span
                              class="vb-testimonial__title"
                              >Chief Financial Officer
                            </span></cite
                          >
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
                      <div class="vb-testimonial">
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__content">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__text">
                            Mathew's credentials speak volumes, but his true value lies in his coaching attitude and
                            knowledge-sharing approach. His unique method helps CXOs and leaders recognize their current
                            standing and drive collective growth. By using frameworks and thought-provoking questions,
                            he prompts self-discovery and realization of potential. I am grateful for his coaching and
                            highly recommend him to any organization seeking to develop their senior leadership
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__footer">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__image">
                            <img
                              decoding="async"
                              src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/Ashish-Duggal-poiesis-coaching.jpg"
                              alt="Ashish Duggal"
                            />
                          </div>
                          <cite class="vb-testimonial__cite"
                            ><span class="vb-testimonial__name">Ashish Duggal</span><span class="vb-testimonial__title">
                              Co-Founder &amp; CEO at Poiesis CEO, Xmplar ERP Solutions</span
                            ></cite
                          >
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
                      <div class="vb-testimonial">
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__content">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__text">
                            After leaving my corporate job, I turned to Mathew to help launch my new venture. He guided
                            me in developing an entrepreneurial mindset before diving into technical details. Mathew’s
                            patience and role as a Business Coach were invaluable as I clarified and crystallised my
                            ideas. He then helped refine my Business Plan, strategy, and implementation. His motivation,
                            encouragement, and generosity with time and advice are exceptional. I highly recommend
                            Mathew and VentureBean.
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__footer">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__image">
                            <img
                              decoding="async"
                              src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/Jayasri-Prasad-Sine-Qua-coaching.jpg"
                              alt="Jayasri Prasad"
                            />
                          </div>
                          <cite class="vb-testimonial__cite"
                            ><span class="vb-testimonial__name">Jayasri Prasad</span><span
                              class="vb-testimonial__title"
                            >
                              Founder and CEO, Sine Qua Non Sustainability CEO, Xmplar ERP Solutions</span
                            ></cite
                          >
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
                      <div class="vb-testimonial">
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__content">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__text">
                            Mathew is working with me and my leadership team as an Executive Coach, helping us identify
                            areas of improvement in leadership roles as we work on building the second line of
                            leadership in our business scaling plans. I recommend his customised proprietary Coaching
                            approach for its simplicity yet effectiveness in leadership, people growth.
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__footer">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__image">
                            <img
                              decoding="async"
                              src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/Thomas-P.-Thomas-Zyxware-Technologies-consulting.jpg"
                              alt="Thomas P. Thomas"
                            />
                          </div>
                          <cite class="vb-testimonial__cite"
                            ><span class="vb-testimonial__name">Thomas P. Thomas</span><span
                              class="vb-testimonial__title">CEO, Zyxware Technologies CEO, Xmplar ERP Solutions</span
                            ></cite
                          >
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="vb-swiper-button vb-swiper-button-prev" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Previous">
                    <i aria-hidden="true" class="eicon-chevron-left"></i>
                  </div>
                  <div class="vb-swiper-button vb-swiper-button-next" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Next">
                    <i aria-hidden="true" class="eicon-chevron-right"></i>
                  </div>
                  <div class="swiper-pagination"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-212a51b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child"
      data-id="212a51b"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div class="e-con-inner">
        <div
          class="vb-element vb-element-464a960 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
          data-id="464a960"
          data-element_type="container"
          data-e-type="container"
        >
          <div
            class="vb-element vb-element-572c446 vb-hidden-desktop vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
            data-id="572c446"
            data-element_type="widget"
            data-e-type="widget"
            data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
          >
            <div class="vb-widget-container"><p>COACHING</p></div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="vb-element vb-element-9117214 vb-testimonial--align-left vb-testimonial--skin-bubble vb-testimonial--layout-image_above vb-arrows-yes vb-pagination-type-bullets vb-widget vb-widget-testimonial-carousel"
            data-id="9117214"
            data-element_type="widget"
            data-e-type="widget"
            data-settings={'{"slides_per_view":"2","slides_to_scroll":"2","lazyload":"yes","show_arrows":"yes","pagination":"bullets","speed":500,"autoplay":"yes","autoplay_speed":5000,"loop":"yes","pause_on_hover":"yes","pause_on_interaction":"yes","space_between":{"unit":"px","size":10,"sizes":[]},"space_between_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":10,"sizes":[]},"space_between_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":10,"sizes":[]}}'}
            data-widget_type="testimonial-carousel.default"
          >
            <div class="vb-widget-container">
              <div class="vb-swiper">
                <div class="vb-main-swiper swiper" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Slides">
                  <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                    <div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
                      <div class="vb-testimonial">
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__content">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__text">
                            VentureBean Consulting provided advisory inputs to the management at Moolya and helped
                            structure things better in the company. We recommend VentureBean for all SMBs who need to
                            feel confident about themselves.
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__footer">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__image">
                            <img
                              loading="lazy"
                              src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/Pradeep-Soundararajan-Moolya-_-consulting.jpg"
                              alt="Pradeep Soundararajan"
                            />
                          </div>
                          <cite class="vb-testimonial__cite"
                            ><span class="vb-testimonial__name">Pradeep Soundararajan</span><span
                              class="vb-testimonial__title">Founder &amp; Managing Director – Moolya</span
                            ></cite
                          >
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
                      <div class="vb-testimonial">
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__content">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__text">
                            Team VentureBean – Thank you for the detailed final report. This was definitely a fruitful
                            and fulfilling engagement, which helped me in understanding the areas where I have to
                            focus/concentrate on. Thanks for your open and transparent feedback, which should help us
                            move forward.
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__footer">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__image">
                            <img
                              loading="lazy"
                              src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/Rajumohan-R-Xmplar-ERP-Solutions-consulting.jpg"
                              alt="Rajumohan R"
                            />
                          </div>
                          <cite class="vb-testimonial__cite"
                            ><span class="vb-testimonial__name">Rajumohan R</span><span class="vb-testimonial__title"
                              >CEO, Xmplar ERP Solutions CEO, Xmplar ERP Solutions</span
                            ></cite
                          >
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
                      <div class="vb-testimonial">
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__content">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__text">
                            We are an SMB in the specialty coffee market in India. VentureBean brought valuable
                            experience, helping us take our product online and increase visibility. They guided us in
                            establishing the ideal marketing mix, audience segmentation, and a strong go-to-market
                            strategy, focusing on B2B2C channels. We highly recommend VentureBean for SMBs needing
                            guidance in marketing, business process improvement, and finance.
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__footer">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__image">
                            <img loading="lazy" src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/Akash.png" alt="Akash J Ovian" />
                          </div>
                          <cite class="vb-testimonial__cite"
                            ><span class="vb-testimonial__name">Akash J Ovian</span><span class="vb-testimonial__title"
                              >Head of Marketing, Naivo Café</span
                            ></cite
                          >
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
                      <div class="vb-testimonial">
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__content">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__text">
                            We appreciate the support and wonderful experience we've had with the VentureBean team.
                            Their promptness, professionalism, knowledge, and flexibility have been exceptional. Their
                            friendliness and openness to our ideas have built our trust in their judgment. We look
                            forward to a long, mutually beneficial partnership as we continue to grow together.
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="vb-testimonial__footer">
                          <div class="vb-testimonial__image">
                            <img
                              loading="lazy"
                              src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/Bharat-Arya-nordic-seed-consulting.jpg"
                              alt="Bharat Arya"
                            />
                          </div>
                          <cite class="vb-testimonial__cite"
                            ><span class="vb-testimonial__name">Bharat Arya</span><span class="vb-testimonial__title"
                              >CEO – Nordic Seed Design Pte Limited CEO, Xmplar ERP Solutions</span
                            ></cite
                          >
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="vb-swiper-button vb-swiper-button-prev" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Previous">
                    <i aria-hidden="true" class="eicon-chevron-left"></i>
                  </div>
                  <div class="vb-swiper-button vb-swiper-button-next" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Next">
                    <i aria-hidden="true" class="eicon-chevron-right"></i>
                  </div>
                  <div class="swiper-pagination"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="vb-element vb-element-3599f88 e-con-full vb-hidden-tablet vb-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con e-child"
          data-id="3599f88"
          data-element_type="container"
          data-e-type="container"
        >
          <div
            class="vb-element vb-element-763e28c vb-hidden-tablet vb-hidden-mobile vb-widget vb-widget-heading"
            data-id="763e28c"
            data-element_type="widget"
            data-e-type="widget"
            id="consulting"
            data-widget_type="heading.default"
          >
            <div class="vb-widget-container"><h2 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">CONSULTING</h2></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-ae675cb vb-align-center vb-widget vb-widget-button"
      data-id="ae675cb"
      data-element_type="widget"
      data-e-type="widget"
      data-widget_type="button.default"
    >
      <div class="vb-widget-container">
        <div class="vb-button-wrapper">
          <a class="vb-button vb-button-link vb-size-sm" href="/testimonials/">
            <span class="vb-button-content-wrapper"> <span class="vb-button-text">More Testimonials</span> </span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
